    <element class="IheTransaction" hash="[https://www.3lgm2.de/resource/ihe/ATNA_SN; https://www.3lgm2.de/resource/ihe/iti-19; https://www.3lgm2.de/resource/ihe/ATNA_SA]">
      <field name="name">ITI-19 Authenticate Node</field>
      <field name="description">This transaction is embedded within all network communications activity. All DICOM, HL7, and HTML connections shall comply with the IHE specification for bi-directional authentication and authorization of communications of Protected Healthcare Information (PHI). IHE does not specify how other protocols that transfer PHI shall perform bi-directional authentication and authorization, but requires that other protocols perform such authentication and authorization.</field>
    </element>
